163
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,040
and was elected.

164
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:12,760
So I went through the whole OA thing as an adult.

165
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:15,800
I've been in the fall for something like 10 years,

166
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:20,680
including being a vigilante member of the OA.

167
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:21,960
