168
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,920
A lot of it is a scout master,

169
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:27,800
but also some of it as a leading work, cruise

170
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,920
in the lodge and things like that

